---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`Terms of use | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="The rules for using the Autophagy app and website. Plain English. Use at your own risk."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Terms of use</h1>
			<p><em>Effective 15 May 2026.</em></p>

			<h2>Plain summary</h2>
			<p>
				Use the Autophagy app and website at your own risk. Nothing here is
				medical advice. The app is a logger for practices associated with the
				biological process of autophagy. It doesn't diagnose, treat, prevent,
				or cure anything. Before you start fasting, cold immersion, sauna use,
				breathing protocols, or any new exercise programme, talk to a qualified
				healthcare professional, especially if you have any pre-existing
				condition.
			</p>

			<h2>1. What Autophagy is</h2>
			<p>
				Autophagy is an iOS app and accompanying website. The app lets you log
				five practices (fasting, exercise, cold immersion, sauna, Reset
				Breathing), see your activity in a daily score and weekly grid, and read
				supporting articles. The website hosts those articles and supporting
				content.
			</p>

			<h2>2. Not medical advice</h2>
			<p>
				The information in the app and on the website is general and educational.
				It is not medical, clinical, nutritional, or therapeutic advice. We are
				not a healthcare provider. We don't have a doctor-patient or
				practitioner-client relationship with you.
			</p>
			<p>
				The practices described — fasting, cold immersion, sauna use, breath
				work, exercise — can cause harm if practised carelessly or by people who
				shouldn't be doing them. Don't begin any of these practices on the
				strength of anything you read here without first checking with a doctor
				or other qualified professional who knows your medical history.
			</p>

			<h2>3. Specific safety reminders</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Cold immersion can trigger cold-shock response and is dangerous for people with cardiovascular conditions. Never practise it alone in open water. Never combine it with alcohol.</li>
				<li>Breath-hold protocols, including the cyclical breathing protocol we call Reset Breathing in the app, can cause loss of consciousness. Never practise them in water or while driving.</li>
				<li>Fasting beyond 24 hours has medical considerations. People with eating disorders, diabetes, or who are pregnant or breastfeeding should not fast without medical supervision.</li>
				<li>Sauna use raises core temperature and stresses the cardiovascular system. Limit session duration if you're new to it, and stop if you feel faint.</li>
				<li>Any new training programme should be ramped up gradually and adapted to your fitness baseline.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				If you experience symptoms during any of these practices that are unusual
				or alarming, stop immediately and seek medical advice.
			</p>

			<h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
			<p>You agree not to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Reverse-engineer, decompile, or attempt to extract the source code of the app beyond what's allowed by applicable law</li>
				<li>Use the content of the website or app to claim Autophagy endorses any specific medical or commercial product or service</li>
				<li>Use the app or website for any unlawful purpose</li>
				<li>Misrepresent yourself as the operator of Autophagy</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>5. Account, subscriptions, and pricing</h2>
			<p>
				The Autophagy app does not require an account. You don't sign in.
			</p>
			<p>
				The current version of the app is free. A premium tier is planned for a
				future release. If you reserve "founder pricing" through the app, you
				are expressing a non-binding intent to subscribe at the founder rate
				when the premium tier launches. No charge is taken at the point of
				reservation. The founder rate is honoured at our discretion once the
				premium tier ships and only for users who reserved before its launch.
			</p>
			<p>
				If and when subscriptions are activated, they will be processed by
				Apple under Apple's standard in-app purchase terms. You can manage and
				cancel subscriptions through your Apple ID in iOS Settings.
			</p>

			<h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
			<p>
				All content on the autophagy.fit website (articles, images, logos) and
				within the app (interface, copy, artwork) is owned by Alamex Ltd or its
				licensors and protected by copyright. You may read, share, and quote
				articles for non-commercial purposes with attribution and a link back.
				Bulk republication or commercial reuse requires written permission.
			</p>

			<h2>7. Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2>
			<p>
				The Autophagy app and website are provided "as is" and "as available,"
				without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We don't warrant
				that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or suitable for any
				particular purpose.
			</p>
			<p>
				To the maximum extent permitted by law, Alamex Ltd and its officers,
				employees, and contractors will not be liable for any direct, indirect,
				incidental, special, consequential, or exemplary damages arising out of
				your use of, or inability to use, the app or website, including but not
				limited to physical injury, loss of data, or loss of earnings.
			</p>
			<p>
				Nothing in these terms excludes liability for death or personal injury
				caused by our negligence, fraud, or any other liability that cannot
				lawfully be excluded under the law of England and Wales.
			</p>

			<h2>8. Changes to these terms</h2>
			<p>
				We may update these terms over time. The current version's effective
				date is at the top. Material changes will be flagged inside the app on
				next launch.
			</p>

			<h2>9. Governing law</h2>
			<p>
				These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes
				will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England
				and Wales.
			</p>

			<h2>10. Contact</h2>
			<p>
				Questions about these terms: autophagy@alamex.com
			</p>
			<p>
				Autophagy is operated by Alamex Ltd, a company registered in England and
				Wales.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
